B.Wz=s(["Her yeni g\xfcn, yaz\u0131lmay\u0131 bekleyen bembeyaz bir sayfad\u0131r.","K\xfc\xe7\xfck anlar, hayat\u0131n en b\xfcy\xfck hazineleridir.","Ya\u011fmurdan sonraki toprak kokusu gibi, ruhunu taze tut.","Gelecek, bug\xfcnden umut ekenlerin bah\xe7esidir.","Kendi hikayenin yazar\u0131 sensin; b\u0131rak kelimelerin \xf6zg\xfcrce aks\u0131n.","En karanl\u0131k gece bile sona erer ve g\xfcne\u015f yeniden do\u011far.","Saklanm\u0131\u015f bir tebess\xfcm, g\xfcn\xfcn y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc de\u011fi\u015ftirebilir.","Kendine ay\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n her sessiz an, ruhuna bir arma\u011fand\u0131r.","Bir tohumun ye\u015fermesi sab\u0131r ister, kendi b\xfcy\xfcmeni kutla.","An\u0131lar\u0131m\u0131z, r\xfczgara f\u0131s\u0131ldad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z en g\xfczel \u015fark\u0131lard\u0131r.","Bazen yava\u015flamak, en h\u0131zl\u0131 ilerleme \u015feklidir.","D\xfc\u015f\xfcncelerin, g\xf6ky\xfcz\xfcndeki bulutlar gibidir; gelip ge\xe7erler.","\u0130\xe7indeki huzuru buldu\u011funda, d\u0131\u015far\u0131daki f\u0131rt\u0131nalar diner.","Her ad\u0131m, ne kadar k\xfc\xe7\xfck olursa olsun seni ileri ta\u015f\u0131r.","Su yata\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bulur, kalbini ak\u0131\u015fa b\u0131rak.","Bug\xfcn, d\xfcn\xfcn hayali; yar\u0131n\u0131n ise hat\u0131ras\u0131d\u0131r.","K\xf6klerini derinlere salan a\u011fa\xe7lar, en sert r\xfczgarlarda bile y\u0131k\u0131lmazlar."],t.s)
